WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.668
The Python lab follows one consistent logic Define
the meaning

00:00:05.695 --> 00:00:11.289
first Assess quality second Then choose a dtype
encoding

00:00:11.487 --> 00:00:18.311
or scaling method Finally perform the analysis The

00:00:18.338 --> 00:00:24.789
temptation is to let pandas or scikit-learn decide
what a variable means Instead

00:00:25.052 --> 00:00:28.526
use software to implement a conceptual decision you
can explain
